---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HirePlanner from '../components/HirePlanner.astro';
import FleetCards from '../components/FleetCards.astro';
---
<Layout title="Vehicle hire in Pita Kotte & Colombo | Nissan Caravan & Benz | Saumya Tours" description="Request local vehicle hire from Pita Kotte for Colombo transfers, airport trips, day outings, and events. Choose a Nissan Caravan or Mercedes-Benz AMG C-Class.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Local hires</p><h1>Your plans.<br />Our wheels.</h1><p>Local vehicle hires from Pita Kotte for everyday transfers, family outings, and occasions worth arriving for. Choose your vehicle and request a quote for your route.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="#hire-planner" class="button button-primary">Plan a local hire</a><a href="/fleet" class="text-link">Meet the fleet</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><HirePlanner /></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>A ride for your kind of day.</h2><p>Our fleet includes one Nissan Caravan and one Mercedes-Benz AMG C-Class. Availability is confirmed for each request.</p></div></div><FleetCards /></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><h2>From the everyday<br />to the once-in-a-while.</h2></div><div class="values-grid"><div class="value"><h3>Airport transfers</h3><p>Share your flight time, pickup address, group size, and luggage details. Ask about a one-way or return transfer.</p></div><div class="value"><h3>Day trips & local travel</h3><p>Plan a family outing, appointments, business visits, or a day with several stops. Send your route for a tailored quote.</p></div><div class="value"><h3>Weddings & occasions</h3><p>Ask about the AMG C-Class for your event. Tell us the date, timings, pickup, and waiting requirements.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container faq"><div class="section-intro"><h2>Your hire questions, answered.</h2></div><details><summary>How is the hire price calculated?</summary><p>Request a written quote for your vehicle, route, dates, duration, and stops. Ask whether fuel, driver arrangements, waiting time, parking, and tolls are included before confirming.</p></details><details><summary>Can I book a guide as well?</summary><p>Yes, you can request guide arrangements with your hire. Tell us the places you want to visit and your preferred language. The team will confirm availability and any additional cost.</p></details><details><summary>How many travelers can each vehicle take?</summary><p>Please send your group size and luggage details. Our team will confirm the actual seating configuration and space before accepting your request.</p></details><details><summary>Is my WhatsApp request a confirmed booking?</summary><p>No. The request starts a conversation. Your vehicle, price, schedule, and terms must be confirmed directly with our team.</p></details></div></section>
</Layout>
